# StyleUp Backend — Repo Map

Single NestJS 10 API (hexagonal). Postgres (TypeORM + Flyway) + Redis (OTP/sessions + BullMQ). Not a monorepo.

## Search strategy

1. Use this map (and Quick lookup) to pick the folder/file.
2. Open those paths first.
3. Grep/search the wider repo **only** if this map does not cover the task.
4. Prefer existing rules/skills under `.cursor/` for how-to; this file is **where**.

## Quick lookup

| If the task involves... | Look first in... |
|---|---|
| App bootstrap / module wiring | `src/main.ts`, `src/app.module.ts` |
| Adding/changing an API route | `src/modules/<domain>/*.controller.ts`, `dto/` |
| Business / domain logic | `src/modules/<domain>/*.service.ts`, `domain/`, `ports/` |
| Persistence adapters (Postgres) | `src/infra/persistence/postgres/<domain>/` |
| Persistence adapters (Redis) | `src/infra/persistence/redis/` |
| Auth adapters (JWT, email/SMS) | `src/infra/auth/` |
| DB schema / migrations | `db/migrations/V*.sql`, Flyway: `flyway.config.js` |
| Seed / demo data | `seed/`, `seed/seeder.js` (`pnpm seed`) |
| Shared types / DTOs (cross-module) | `src/shared/types/` |
| Guards, filters, interceptors | `src/common/` |
| Env / config validation | `src/config/`, `.env.example`, `.env.test` |
| Health checks | `src/health/` |
| BullMQ queue / job | `src/modules/rating/` (+ `.cursor/skills/bullmq-queue-authoring`) |
| Unit tests | colocated `*.spec.ts` under `src/` |
| E2E tests / helpers | `test/*.e2e-spec.ts`, `test/helpers/` |
| Docker / local Postgres+Redis | `docker-compose.yml`, `Dockerfile` |
| Agent rules / skills | `.cursor/rules/`, `.cursor/skills/`, `.claude/skills/` |

## Top-level layout

| Path | Responsibility | Check first |
|---|---|---|
| `src/` | Application source | `main.ts`, `app.module.ts`, `modules/`, `infra/` |
| `db/migrations/` | Flyway SQL schema versions | next `V<n>__*.sql` |
| `seed/` | Idempotent SQL seeds | `seeder.js`, `01-auth/` … `04-transactions/` |
| `test/` | E2E Jest suites + helpers | `*.e2e-spec.ts`, `helpers/`, `jest-e2e.json` |
| `docker-compose.yml` | Local PostGIS + Redis (+ app) | postgres `env_file: .env.test` |
| `flyway.config.js` | Migration runner config | `DATABASE_URL` / `POSTGRES_*` |
| `data-source.ts` | TypeORM CLI data source | rarely; schema via Flyway |
| `package.json` | Scripts (`test`, `test:e2e*`, `migrate`, `seed`) | scripts block |
| `.cursor/` | Project rules + skills | `rules/`, `skills/` |
| `.claude/skills/` | Claude-oriented skills (Flyway, Nest standards) | mirror of some `.cursor` guidance |
| `.agents/` | Agent tooling metadata | usually ignore for product work |
| `README.md` | Human overview | — |
| `.env` / `.env.test` / `.env.example` | Runtime / test / template env | never commit secrets |
| `dist/` | Build output | ignore |
| `node_modules/` | Dependencies | ignore |
| `.flyway/` | Flyway CLI cache | ignore |
| `.pnpm-store/` | Local pnpm store | ignore |
| `report.html` / `report.json` | Flyway run reports | ignore |
| `.github/` | CI workflows | **absent** today |

