| Module | Path | Responsibility | Key files |
|---|---|---|---|
| auth | `src/modules/auth/` | OTP login, tokens, sessions, social | `auth.controller.ts`, `auth.service.ts`, `ports/`, `domain/` |
| bookings | `src/modules/bookings/` | Availability, quote, create/pay booking | `bookings.controller.ts`, `bookings.service.ts`, `ports/` |
| discovery | `src/modules/discovery/` | Home, map, search, categories | `discovery.controller.ts`, `discovery.service.ts`, `ports/` |
| shops | `src/modules/shops/` | Shop profile, packages, specialists | `shops.controller.ts`, `shops.service.ts`, `ports/` |
| rating | `src/modules/rating/` | BullMQ rating recompute queue | `rating.processor.ts`, `rating-producer.service.ts`, `rating.constants.ts` |
| notifications | `src/modules/notifications/` | Placeholder (empty) | — |
| payments | `src/modules/payments/` | Placeholder (empty); pay flow is under bookings | — |
| providers | `src/modules/providers/` | Placeholder (empty) | — |
| services | `src/modules/services/` | Placeholder (empty) | — |
| users | `src/modules/users/` | Placeholder (empty); users live in auth/postgres | — |

