### Schema & seed

| Path | Responsibility |
|---|---|
| `db/migrations/` | Sole schema source (Flyway CE); do not edit applied files |
| `seed/01-auth/` … `04-transactions/` | Ordered SQL seeds; `00-roles.sql` = system `customer` role |
| `seed/seeder.js` | Runner (`pnpm seed` → `.env` / `DATABASE_URL`) |

### Connections

| Concern | Config location |
|---|---|
| Postgres | `src/config/configuration.ts`, `postgres.config.ts`, `DATABASE_URL` / `POSTGRES_*` |
| Redis | same config + `REDIS_URL` / `REDIS_HOST` |
| BullMQ | `app.module.ts` `BullModule.forRootAsync` → Redis |
| SMTP | `SMTP_*` → `smtp.*` in configuration |

