| Unit | `src/**/*.spec.ts` next to source |
| E2E | `test/*.e2e-spec.ts` |
| E2E bootstrap | `test/helpers/create-test-app.ts` |
| E2E DB/Redis reset | `test/helpers/postgres-test-utils.ts`, `redis-test-utils.ts` (truncate excludes `roles`, `spatial_ref_sys`, `flyway_schema_history`) |
| E2E config | `test/jest-e2e.json`, `test/setup-env.ts` |
| Unit Jest | `jest.config.ts` |

## Agent guidance (not product code)

| Path | Use for |
|---|---|
| `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` | Always/glob rules (architecture, auth, Flyway, e2e, verification) |
| `.cursor/skills/*/SKILL.md` | On-demand skills (e2e-testing, testing-workflow, postgres, bullmq) |
| `.claude/skills/` | Flyway + Nest standards for Claude |

## Ignore / irrelevant to product tasks

`node_modules/`, `dist/`, `.flyway/`, `.pnpm-store/`, `report.html`, `report.json`, `.git/`, lockfile churn unless dependency task.
